<title>BELGIUM: BELECTRIC 95/96 PROFIT RISES,DIVIDEND DOWN.</title>
<headline>BELECTRIC 95/96 PROFIT RISES,DIVIDEND DOWN.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to September 30,</p>
<p>1996 (in millions of Belgian francs unless stated):</p>
<p>    Net profit		   2,874  vs    472</p>
<p>    Net dividend(francs)	  21  vs     30</p>
<p>    Operating loss		(338) vs (5,356)</p>
<p>    Financial revenues	 2,654  vs  5,292</p>
<p>    Exceptional gains	  1,757  vs    520</p>
<p>NOTE - Belectric is a unit of Lonrho Continental (formerly</p>
<p>Lonrho Belgium) which is 82.5 percent owned by Lonrho</p>
<p>Plc .</p>
<p>-- Nick Antonovics, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6817,</p>
<p>Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
